{"unit_id":"vibe-any__dsh-plugin-save-token#card-zh","repo":"vibe-any/dsh-plugin-save-token","commit":"eb85c421758e56d6a1ae8c87dd10f0d38e621559","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Save Token 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的上下文管理插件：它在工具结果返回后执行去重与压缩，并提供原文恢复工具和浏览器面板。它优先对均匀 JSON 表格做无损 TOON 式编码，再对其他大型文本按结构取窗口；每次替换前将原文交给 spillStore 保存，通知中附恢复标识。插件还统计模型用量、缓存与节省估算，支持可选的上下文压力压缩。适合希望减少重复或冗长工具输出、同时保留原文取回能力的 DSH Web 用户；需要宿主提供 spillStore，未配置时压缩会停用。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:244-355","src/compress.js:467-620"]}
{"unit_id":"vibe-any__dsh-plugin-save-token#card-en","repo":"vibe-any/dsh-plugin-save-token","commit":"eb85c421758e56d6a1ae8c87dd10f0d38e621559","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Save Token compresses and deduplicates DSH Web tool results, favoring lossless TOON-style table encoding. It stores originals through spillStore for recovery and provides a dashboard for usage and compression metrics.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:244-355","src/compress.js:467-620"]}
